   "source": ["# ðŸŒ± CarbonTrack â€” Data Understanding\n\n**Project:** Predicting Household Carbon Footprint Using Lifestyle Data  \n**Author:** Mohamed Aries B (RA2311026050100)  \n**Department:** CSE - AIML, SRM Institute of Science and Technology  \n\n---\n\nThis notebook covers **Phase 1: Data Understanding** â€” loading, profiling, and summarising the household carbon footprint dataset to understand its structure, distributions, and quality."]
